<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="570332133"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1538288090"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="NE:ONE"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Survive Said The Prophet"/><amll:meta key="album" value="NE:ONE / HI | LO (初回生産限定盤)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:14.119"><div begin="00:13.724" end="04:08.545"><p begin="00:13.724" end="00:16.214" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">越えたくて、ただ変えたくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渴望超越自我 渴望有所改变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko e ta ku te ta da ka e ta ku te</span></p><p begin="00:16.225" end="00:19.589" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">自分自身を追い詰めてみたりしたって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不断追逐着自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji bu n ji shi n wo o i</span></p><p begin="00:19.757" end="00:22.169" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">正直になれなくなって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却还是无法诚实面对自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sho u ji ki ni na re na ku na 't te</span></p><p begin="00:22.173" end="00:27.474" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">Did you burn or let yourself just fade away ?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是选择煎熬忍受还是选择灰飞烟灭？</span></p><p begin="00:28.199" end="00:32.910" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">Did you burn or let yourself just fade away ?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是选择煎熬忍受还是选择灰飞烟灭？</span></p><p begin="00:34.208" end="00:39.857" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">Is it better just to burn than fade away ?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">煎熬忍受比灰飞烟灭是否是更好的选择？</span></p><p begin="00:48.900" end="00:51.909" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">Some live the dream to die for this moment<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有些人一生的梦想就是此刻的陨灭</span></p><p begin="00:52.015" end="00:54.850" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">Some wait for signs for heavens to open<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有些人等待天堂之门的开启</span></p><p begin="00:54.983" end="00:57.716" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">It's not pretending who you are<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不必伪装真实的自我</span></p><p begin="00:57.850" end="01:00.615" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">If we are the proof of what we've done<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果我们就是所作所为的见证</span></p><p begin="01:00.799" end="01:02.154" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">To do what is right<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那究竟是该选择正义</span></p><p begin="01:02.254" end="01:03.655" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">Or do what you're told<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还是遵循他人安排呢？</span></p><p begin="01:03.853" end="01:06.714" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">They're both the same, can't make everyone happy<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都是一样的 我们无法让所有人都满意</span></p><p begin="01:07.019" end="01:09.719" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">It's not pretending who you are<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不必伪装真实的自我</span></p><p begin="01:09.852" end="01:14.196" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">If we are the proof of what we've done<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果我们就是所作所为的见证</span></p><p begin="01:19.753" end="01:22.214" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">越えたくて、ただ変えたくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渴望超越自我 渴望有所改变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko e ta ku te ta da ka e ta ku te</span></p><p begin="01:22.218" end="01:25.612" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">自分自身を追い詰めてみたりしたって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不断追逐着自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji bu n ji shi n wo o i</span></p><p begin="01:25.732" end="01:28.180" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">正直になれなくなって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却还是无法诚实面对自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sho u ji ki ni na re na ku na 't te</span></p><p begin="01:28.184" end="01:33.110" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">Did you burn or let yourself just fade away ?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是选择煎熬忍受还是选择灰飞烟灭？</span></p><p begin="01:34.176" end="01:39.076" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">Did you burn or let yourself just fade away ?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是选择煎熬忍受还是选择灰飞烟灭？</span></p><p begin="01:40.241" end="01:45.473" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">Is it better just to burn than fade away ?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">煎熬忍受比灰飞烟灭是否是更好的选择？</span></p><p begin="01:55.036" end="01:57.836" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">If I lived my dream to die for this moment<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若我此生的梦想就是此刻的陨灭</span></p><p begin="01:57.901" end="02:00.769" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">Would I chose the same, in spite what the world says ?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是否会忽略外界的声音仍坚持这样的选择？</span></p><p begin="02:01.035" end="02:03.727" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">It's not pretending who you are<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不必伪装真实的自我</span></p><p begin="02:03.915" end="02:06.596" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">If we are the proof of what we've done<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果我们就是所作所为的见证</span></p><p begin="02:06.995" end="02:08.122" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">What makes it right ?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是什么让世界回归正轨？</span></p><p begin="02:08.390" end="02:09.546" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">And who makes it wrong ?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又是谁让世界满是不堪？</span></p><p begin="02:09.978" end="02:12.795" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">Who in the hell decided this all along ?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">究竟是谁决定这一切？</span></p><p begin="02:13.032" end="02:15.667" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">It's not pretending anymore<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不必再伪装掩饰了</span></p><p begin="02:15.844" end="02:20.486" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">If we are the proof of what we've done<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果我们就是所作所为的见证</span></p><p begin="02:25.768" end="02:28.188" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">越えたくて、消え去ったって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渴望超越自我 就算最终化为乌有</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko e ta ku te ki e sa 't ta 't te</span></p><p begin="02:28.197" end="02:31.555" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">守るものを守れたと言い聞かせて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也对自己说 我已竭力守护了自己要守护的东西</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma mo ru mo no wo ma mo re ta to i i ki ka se te</span></p><p begin="02:31.737" end="02:34.120" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">正直になれなくなって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却还是无法诚实面对自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sho u ji ki ni na re na ku na 't te</span></p><p begin="02:34.223" end="02:39.253" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">Did you burn or let yourself just fade away ?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是选择煎熬忍受还是选择灰飞烟灭？</span></p><p begin="02:40.187" end="02:45.320" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">Did you burn or let yourself just fade away ?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是选择煎熬忍受还是选择灰飞烟灭？</span></p><p begin="02:46.253" end="02:51.443" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">Is it better just to burn than fade away ?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">煎熬忍受比灰飞烟灭是否是更好的选择？</span></p><p begin="03:01.776" end="03:04.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">越えたくて、ただ変えたくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渴望超越自我 渴望有所改变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko e ta ku te ta da ka e ta ku te</span></p><p begin="03:04.161" end="03:07.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">We started looking for signs denying every direction<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们开始找寻穷途末路中的些许可能</span></p><p begin="03:07.728" end="03:10.157" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">怖かったとは言えなくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">始终不敢说出内心的恐惧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko wa ka 't ta to wa i e na ku te</span></p><p begin="03:10.191" end="03:17.120" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">Do we burn or let ourselves just fade away ?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们是选择煎熬忍受还是选择灰飞烟灭？</span></p><p begin="03:16.251" end="03:19.445" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">Is it better just to burn than fade ?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">煎熬忍受比灰飞烟灭是否是更好的选择？</span></p><p begin="03:20.507" end="03:22.907" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">誰よりも越えていきたくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">比任何人都渴望超越自我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re yo ri mo ko e te i ki ta ku te</span></p><p begin="03:22.908" end="03:26.408" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">自分自身を追い詰めてみたりしたって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不断追逐着自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji bu n ji shi n wo o i</span></p><p begin="03:26.541" end="03:28.907" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">正直になれなくなって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却还是无法诚实面对自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sho u ji ki ni na re na ku na 't te</span></p><p begin="03:28.958" end="03:34.040" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">Did you burn or let yourself just fade away ?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是选择煎熬忍受还是选择灰飞烟灭？</span></p><p begin="03:34.973" end="03:43.040" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">Did you burn or let yourself just fade away ?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是选择煎熬忍受还是选择灰飞烟灭？</span></p><p begin="03:44.541" end="03:46.941" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">越えたくて、ただ変えたくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渴望超越自我 渴望有所改变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko e ta ku te ta da ka e ta ku te</span></p><p begin="03:46.970" end="03:52.108" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">Do we burn or let ourselves just fade away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们是选择煎熬忍受还是选择灰飞烟灭？</span></p><p begin="03:50.460" end="03:53.539" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">正直になれなくなって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却还是无法诚实面对自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sho u ji ki ni na re na ku na 't te</span></p><p begin="03:53.025" end="03:58.886" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">Is it better just to burn than fade away ?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">煎熬忍受比灰飞烟灭是否是更好的选择？</span></p><p begin="03:56.485" end="03:59.550" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">怖かったとは言えなくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">始终不敢说出内心的恐惧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko wa ka 't ta to wa i e na ku te</span></p><p begin="03:58.965" end="04:04.931" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">Do we burn or let ourselves just fade away?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们是选择煎熬忍受还是选择灰飞烟灭？</span></p><p begin="04:02.476" end="04:05.401" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">越えたくて、ただ変えたくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渴望超越自我 渴望有所改变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko e ta ku te ta da ka e ta ku te</span></p><p begin="04:05.491" end="04:08.545" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">誰よりも越えていきたくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">比任何人都渴望超越自我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re yo ri mo ko e te i ki ta ku te</span></p></div></body></tt>